WEBVTT

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.350
Um, move the meeting to Wednesday at 3 p.m.—

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.900
No, make that Thursday at 3 p.m.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.650
Everyone, remember to bring the project report.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:16.950
Meeting moved to Thursday at 3 p.m.
Please bring the project report.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.450
Verbatim transcription.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.700
Write a concise weekly report for the team.
Do not add work I haven't mentioned.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.400
This week: redesigned the login page
and fixed several issues.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.400
I want a tool to organize team files.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.950
What file types? Who will use it?

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:33.150
Start with our internal team.
It will mainly organize project documents.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:37.650
Use it only on this computer for now.
No collaboration.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Files are scattered and hard to find.
The initial plan was for a team.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.950
The plan now: use it on this computer.
No collaboration.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.950
Translate spoken Chinese into English.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.950
Taiwan Traditional Chinese:
file management, mouse controls, low memory use.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.950
Dictionary: keep names and terms consistent.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.950
Choose an on-device speech model.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.950
Search history and retry a recording.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.950
Activity and streaks. Example data.

